  "ir": {
    "name": "loss_log_ratio_softplus_advantage_scaleinv",
    "intuition": "Normalize the log-probability ratio by the sum of magnitudes to achieve scale-invariance, then apply an exponential scaling on the advantage gap before computing the softplus loss. This ensures that the loss remains stable under arbitrary scaling of log probabilities.",
    "pseudocode": "ratio = log_prob_w - log_prob_l\nnorm_factor = abs(log_prob_w) + abs(log_prob_l) + epsilon\nscale_factor = exp(advantage_gap)\nscaled_ratio = (ratio / norm_factor) * scale_factor\nloss = softplus(-scaled_ratio) * weight\nfinal_loss = mean(loss)",
